<!--meta {"lead": "Error pages keep HairPop’s shell around a full-page empty state when a whole page cannot be shown: it does not exist, this account cannot open it, the service failed, or the device is offline.", "description": "404, 403, 500 and offline pages inside the product shell, each with one recovery action.", "pills": ["Status: stable", "Keeps the shell"], "variants": "not found (404), forbidden (403), server error (500, with reference id), offline", "states": "default, action focused, retrying (busy), recovered", "sources": ["pages/not-found/default", "pages/forbidden/default", "pages/server-error/default", "pages/offline/default"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>An error page replaces the page content, not the page: the top bar, navigation and footer stay, so the person can still go anywhere. Inside the main region it is a full-size <a href="empty-state.html">empty state</a> whose title is the page's <code>h1</code>, with one sentence and one recovery action.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Not found (404)</b>: the address is wrong or old. Recover with "Explore styles".</li>
    <li><b>Forbidden (403)</b>: this account cannot open the page, for example another customer's appointment. The page never says whether that appointment exists, and an unknown appointment reference shows the same page. Recover with "Sign in".</li>
    <li><b>Server error (500)</b>: HairPop failed. Say what did not happen ("Your booking request has not been resent"), offer "Try again" and show a reference id for support.</li>
    <li><b>Offline</b>: the device has no connection. Say what still works ("Saved appointment details remain available") and offer "Try again".</li>
  </ul>
  <p>When only part of a page fails, keep the page and use a region error state or a warning alert instead.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy">
    <figure class="ds-anatomy__figure" style="padding: var(--space-4);">
      <div class="ds-frame" style="width: 100%; margin: 0;">
        <header class="topbar"><a class="topbar__brand" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">{{icon:sparkle}}HairPop</a><span class="topbar__spacer"></span><a class="account-link" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">Maya</a></header>
        <div class="ds-frame__body"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">We couldn’t find that page</p><p class="empty__text">The link may be old, or the address may have changed.</p><div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div></section></div>
      </div>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 10%;" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 30%; top: 34%;" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 58%;" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="ds-callout" style="left: 2%; top: 82%;" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    </figure>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Product shell</b><small>Top bar, navigation and footer stay, so every route out remains.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Icon</b><small>Search (404), lock (403), alert (500), wifi-off (offline) in a tinted circle.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Heading and sentence</b><small>The page's <code>h1</code> (styled as the empty title) and one sentence on what happened and what is safe.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Recovery action</b><small>One primary action; a 500 page adds a reference id under it.</small></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  <p>Four variants, one per cause. Each keeps the same structure and changes the icon, tint and copy. In production the title is <code>&lt;h1 class="empty__title"&gt;</code>; these frames use a paragraph so this page keeps one <code>h1</code>.</p>
  <h3>Not found (404)</h3>
  <div class="ds-frame">
    <header class="topbar"><a class="topbar__brand" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">{{icon:sparkle}}HairPop</a><nav class="topbar__nav" aria-label="Primary, not found example"><a class="nav-link" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Styles</a><a class="nav-link" href="../../mocks/pages/matching-braiders/default.html">Braiders</a><a class="nav-link" href="../../mocks/pages/my-appointments/default.html">Appointments</a></nav><span class="topbar__spacer"></span><a class="account-link" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">Maya</a></header>
    <div class="ds-frame__body"><section class="empty empty--stack-actions"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search|icon--lg}}</div><p class="empty__title">We couldn’t find that page</p><p class="empty__text">The link may be old, or the address may have changed.</p><div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">Explore styles</a></div></section></div>
  </div>
  <h3>Forbidden (403)</h3>
  <div class="ds-frame">
    <header class="topbar"><a class="topbar__brand" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">{{icon:sparkle}}HairPop</a><span class="topbar__spacer"></span><a class="account-link" href="../../mocks/pages/sign-in/default.html">Sign in</a></header>
    <div class="ds-frame__body"><section class="empty empty--warning empty--stack-actions"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:lock|icon--lg}}</div><p class="empty__title">You can’t open this page</p><p class="empty__text">Sign in with the account you use for your appointments.</p><div class="empty__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="../../mocks/pages/sign-in/default.html">Sign in</a></div></section></div>
  </div>
  <h3>Server error (500)</h3>
  <div class="ds-frame">
    <header class="topbar"><a class="topbar__brand" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">{{icon:sparkle}}HairPop</a><span class="topbar__spacer"></span><a class="account-link" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">Maya</a></header>
    <div class="ds-frame__body"><section class="empty empty--error empty--stack-actions"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle|icon--lg}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><p class="empty__text">We couldn’t load this page. Your booking request has not been resent.</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button">Try again</button><a class="btn" href="../../mocks/pages/help/default.html">Contact support</a></div><p class="empty__reference">Reference: HP-ERR-7F3K2Q · Sat 10 Oct, 9:42 am</p></section></div>
  </div>
  <h3>Offline</h3>
  <div class="ds-frame">
    <header class="topbar"><a class="topbar__brand" href="../../mocks/pages/style-gallery/default.html">{{icon:sparkle}}HairPop</a><span class="topbar__spacer"></span><a class="account-link" href="../../mocks/pages/account-settings/default.html">Maya</a></header>
    <div class="ds-frame__body"><section class="empty empty--warning empty--stack-actions"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:wifi-off|icon--lg}}</div><p class="empty__title">You’re offline</p><p class="empty__text">Saved appointment details remain available. Requests need a connection.</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button">Try again</button><a class="btn" href="../../mocks/pages/my-appointments/default.html">View saved appointments</a></div></section></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="Error pages always use the full empty-state size inside the page's main region; compact is for regions inside a page."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <p>Error pages are static responses. They have no loading or nested error state of their own; the interactive states belong to the recovery action.</p>
  <div class="ds-matrix"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Variant</th><th scope="col">Default</th><th scope="col">Action focused</th><th scope="col">Retrying</th><th scope="col">Recovered</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th scope="row">Server error</th>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" data-state="focus">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" aria-busy="true">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><p class="text-muted">The requested page loads in place.</p></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Offline</th>
        <td><section class="empty empty--warning empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:wifi-off}}</div><p class="empty__title">You’re offline</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--warning empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:wifi-off}}</div><p class="empty__title">You’re offline</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" data-state="focus">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><section class="empty empty--warning empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:wifi-off}}</div><p class="empty__title">You’re offline</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button" aria-busy="true">Try again</button></div></section></td>
        <td><span class="inline-status inline-status--success" role="status">{{icon:check|icon--sm}}Back online</span></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h3>Both themes</h3>
  {{themes:stack}}<section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">We couldn’t find that page</p></section><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><p class="empty__reference">Reference: HP-ERR-7F3K2Q</p></section><section class="empty empty--warning empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:wifi-off}}</div><p class="empty__title">You’re offline</p></section>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The shell behaves as on every page: top-bar links collapse below 768px; the footer wraps.</li>
    <li>The empty state centres in <code>.product-main</code> with the full padding. It always carries <code>.empty--stack-actions</code>: below 640px the recovery actions stack at the empty state's full content width, primary first; from 640px they sit side by side and centred.</li>
    <li>The reference id wraps rather than overflowing; it is selectable text so it can be copied into a support email.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>Error pages add no tokens: they inherit the shell and the empty-state tokens (<code>--empty-icon-bg</code>, <code>--empty-icon-fg</code>). 404 uses the accent tint so a wrong link does not feel like a failure; 403 and offline use warning; 500 uses danger. The reference id uses <code>--text-code</code> in <code>--color-fg-subtle</code>.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3>
  <p>A normal page: skip link, <code>header</code>, <code>nav</code>, <code>main</code> and <code>footer</code> landmarks, and an <code>&lt;h1 class="empty__title"&gt;</code>. The <code>&lt;title&gt;</code> names the error: "Page not found — HairPop". Serve the matching HTTP status (404, 403, 500).</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3>
  <table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>Skip link, top bar, then the recovery and secondary actions, then the footer. The icon and text are not focusable.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd></td><td>Activate the recovery action.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3>
  <p>On a full page load focus starts at the top as usual. In the single-page app, when a route resolves to an error page, move focus to the <code>h1</code> (<code>tabindex="-1"</code>) so the change is announced. After "Try again" fails, keep focus on the button and announce the result.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3>
  <p>The icon is <code>aria-hidden</code>; the heading carries the meaning. The reference id is plain text labelled "Reference:".</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Heading on page|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}
    {{pair:Sentence on page|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}
    {{pair:Reference id on page|--color-fg-subtle|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}
    {{pair:Danger icon on tint|--color-danger-icon|--color-danger-bg|3}}
    {{pair:Warning icon on tint|--color-warning-icon|--color-warning-bg|3}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3>
  <p>None beyond the shell. The page does not animate in, and "Try again" shows the button's loading state.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3>
  <p>The recovery actions are at least 40px tall and full width below 640px.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Heading in plain words, no codes: "We couldn’t find that page", "You can’t open this page", "HairPop needs a moment", "You’re offline".</li>
    <li>One sentence on what happened and what is safe: "Your booking request has not been resent."</li>
    <li>One recovery action: "Explore styles", "Sign in", "Try again". Add "Contact support" only for 500.</li>
    <li>Never blame the person ("You typed the wrong address"). Never show stack traces.</li>
    <li>500 pages show "Reference:" with an id and time support can find.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--error empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:alert-circle}}</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div><p class="empty__reference">Reference: HP-ERR-7F3K2Q</p></section></div><figcaption>A 500 page with a danger tint and a reference id support can trace.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><p class="empty__title">HairPop needs a moment</p><div class="empty__actions"><button class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div></section></div><figcaption>The service-error mock has no reference id, and its ✦ glyph and accent tint look like a first-run state.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><section class="empty empty--compact"><div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{icon:search}}</div><p class="empty__title">We couldn’t find that page</p></section></div><figcaption>An error page is a static response, rendered immediately.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack"><div class="card" aria-hidden="true"><span class="skeleton skeleton--title"></span><span class="skeleton skeleton--text"></span></div></div><figcaption>Give an error page loading and "error" states, as the first not-found, forbidden and server-error mocks did; an error page cannot meaningfully have them.</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {{tok:404 icon circle|--color-accent-subtle|--color-fg-accent}}
      {{tok:403 / offline icon circle|--color-warning-bg|--color-warning-icon}}
      {{tok:500 icon circle|--color-danger-bg|--color-danger-icon}}
      {{tok:Page background|--color-bg-canvas}}
      {{tok:Reference id|--color-fg-subtle}}
      {{tok:Reference font|--text-code|--font-size-xs}}
      {{tok:Main padding|--space-8|--space-12}}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;main id="main" class="container product-main"&gt;
  &lt;section class="empty empty--error empty--stack-actions"&gt;
    &lt;div class="empty__icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;svg class="icon icon--lg" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;…&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;h1 class="empty__title" tabindex="-1"&gt;HairPop needs a moment&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p class="empty__text"&gt;We couldn’t load this page. Your booking request has not been resent.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;div class="empty__actions"&gt;
      &lt;button class="btn btn--primary" type="button"&gt;Try again&lt;/button&gt;
      &lt;a class="btn" href="/help"&gt;Contact support&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;p class="empty__reference"&gt;Reference: HP-ERR-7F3K2Q · Sat 10 Oct, 9:42 am&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;</code></pre>
  <table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Class / attribute</th><th scope="col">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><code>.product-shell</code> / <code>.product-main</code></td><td>The normal shell; error pages never drop it.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty</code> + <code>.empty--error</code> / <code>.empty--warning</code></td><td>Full-size empty state with the cause's tint (404 uses the default).</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty--stack-actions</code></td><td>Always on an error page: stacks the recovery actions at full width below 640px.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>h1.empty__title</code></td><td>The page heading; <code>tabindex="-1"</code> so client-side routes can focus it.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>.empty__reference</code></td><td>Reference id for 500 pages.</td></tr>
  </tbody></table>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
  <p>Extracted from these mocks:</p>
  <ul>
    {{mock:pages/not-found/default|404}}
    {{mock:pages/forbidden/default|403}}
    {{mock:pages/server-error/default|500}}
    {{mock:pages/offline/default|offline}}
  </ul>
  <p>Drift fixed during extraction: every error page used the ✦ glyph and the accent tint (now an icon and tint per cause); the 500 page had no reference id (now <code>.empty__reference</code>); the empty title was an <code>h2</code> repeating the page header's <code>h1</code> word for word (now the empty title is the page's only <code>h1</code>); the not-found, forbidden, server-error and offline mocks carried loading and error states that a static error response cannot have (dropped; the manifest marks them not applicable); the forbidden sentence "Sign in with the account used for this appointment." implied the appointment exists (now "Sign in with the account you use for your appointments.").</p>
</section>
